<title>UK: LME aluminium holds above $1,650 in ring.</title>
<headline>LME aluminium holds above $1,650 in ring.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Firmer, holds above $1,650. Cash/threes comes around to $8 contango from $12/$10 on Friday.</p>
<p>COPPER - Slightly easier, hovering above $2,500 in thin activity. Cash/threes backwardation slightly narrower at $75/$77.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Softer, mired at lows just around $7,440.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Little changed, quiet.</p>
</text>
